# Slack action icons

Lead Home/modal **action buttons** and in-channel/DM **action notices** with one Slack shortcode. Reuse this vocabulary; do not invent a new name for the same meaning.

| Meaning | Shortcode |
| pause | `:double_vertical_bar:` |
| resume | `:arrow_forward:` |
| leave / stop / end a connection | `:octagonal_sign:` |
| live sync / Refresh | `:arrows_counterclockwise:` |
| edit | `:pencil2:` |
| publish / waiting / export | `:outbox_tray:` |
| join available | `:inbox_tray:` |
| confirm / error | `:warning:` |
| settings | `:gear:` |
| invite workspace | `:incoming_envelope:` |
| managers only / cannot | `:lock:` |
| left a group / hello | `:wave:` |
| group invite or join | `:punch:` |
| new group | `:raised_hands:` |
| accept / granted | `:white_check_mark:` |
| decline / cancel | `:x:` |
| federation | `:globe_with_meridians:` |
| connection code | `:link:` |
| data migration | `:package:` |
| backup | `:floppy_disk:` |
| reset (danger) | `:bomb:` |
| disband / purge | `:wastebasket:` |
| owner | `:key:` |
| give up ownership | `:information_source:` |
| mapping people | `:busts_in_silhouette:` |

Do not icon form field labels, context metadata (Status, Members), modal titles, or the Authorize URL button. One leading emoji per control or notice, then the same wording as today.
